* text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.patch text eol=lf
*.java text eol=lf
*.gradle text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.jar binary
*.lzma binary
*.zip binary
*.pyd binary
*.cfg text eol=lf
*.jks binary

# Binary assets - MUST never go through EOL normalization.
# The `* text eol=lf` rule above applies to every path, so any format not
# listed here gets its CRLF byte pairs collapsed to LF on commit, which
# silently destroys binary content (this corrupted 9 .ogg files).
*.ogg binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.flac binary
*.nbt binary
*.schem binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.tga binary
*.psd binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pyc binary
*.bin binary
*.gz binary
